flowchart TD
    IQVIA[IQVIA Source API / Files] --> RAW[(RAW layer\nSource_Raw sheet)]
    RAW --> LAND[(LANDING layer\nRaw_to_Land sheet)]
    LAND --> CANON[Canonical standardization]
    CANON --> STAGE[(STAGING layer\nLand_to_Stag sheet + DQ rules)]
    STAGE -->|Stg_MDM_Ingress-HCP| MDM_HCP[(MDM.HCP)]
    STAGE -->|Stg_MDM_Ingress-HCO| MDM_HCO[(MDM.HCO + HCO_NAME/PHONE/SPECIALTY/ALT_ID)]
    MDM_HCP -->|Informatica hub-derived child objects| MDM_HCP_CHILD[(MDM.HCP_SPECIALTY / ALTERNATE_NAME / LICENSE / THERAPEUTIC_AREA)]
    MDM_HCP --> EGRESS_HCP[(MASTER.HCP\nMDM_HUB_Egress-HCP_Master)]
    MDM_HCP_CHILD --> EGRESS_HCP
    MDM_HCO --> EGRESS_HCO[(MASTER.HCO*\nMDM_HUB_Egress-HCO_Master)]

    IQVIA -.->|real-time Search-Before-Create| SBC[src/api/sbc.py]
    SBC -.-> MDM_HCP
    IQVIA -.->|Lambda bridge, incl. Licenses| DL[src/api/download_api.py]
    DL -.-> MDM_HCP
